                        "entry_id": "59b6b22f-326e-3e31-b2a0-3ab8944ef673",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The supporting structure of a piece of furniture, a vehicle, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "540dc4a7-a704-4835-96c1-3b574ead360a",
                                "sense_id": "d8eff3f4-cd11-3db8-8a41-45136944ab12",
                                "text": "The main fuel tank is slung from the underframe midway between the two bogies, and its capacity of 420 gal. supplies both the main engine and the train heating boiler."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f13a592f-fd86-4594-8b71-116b77105658",
                                "sense_id": "d8eff3f4-cd11-3db8-8a41-45136944ab12",
                                "text": "Nos. 5300/1, which were finished in January, are the Southern's first \"4-EPB\" units to the standard B.R. design on 63 ft. 5 in. underframes, as against the S.R. 62 ft.; [...]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af78707a-51a6-4b52-926c-615a23748507",
                                "sense_id": "d8eff3f4-cd11-3db8-8a41-45136944ab12",
                                "text": "The Liner train wagon is a simple underframe on bogies, with coned location points that engage recesses in the container bases."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
